    "Task<T> Closure/FnOnce captures and Package fields currently hit prior Types profile fences. Partial Task Package/array and remaining-capture guards are statically present but are not claimed as reached source validation.",
    "These real Await fixtures drain automatic child cleanup before Ready; a child-close Pending after an already Ready result is an implemented saved-result boundary without a reached native source witness in this finite profile.",
    "Ordinary helper origins and partial aggregate histories are conservative; no interprocedural permission inference is granted.",
    "No Rust runtime/RSS/compile-cost comparison or product-wide net advantage claim."
